%description:
Tests the loss of a TCP Fast Open SYN with data. The tester deletes the SYN
of connection 2, which carries the cookie and 200 bytes. The retransmitted SYN
carries neither the Fast Open option nor the data (RFC 7413 section 4.2.2), so
the SYN-ACK acknowledges only the SYN, and the ACK that completes the
handshake carries the 200 bytes ("The client SHOULD retransmit any
unacknowledged data in the first ACK packet"), without Nagle.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000

*.tcptester.script="a3 delete"
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A003] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125200(200) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=8)# deleting
[3.501 A004] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[3.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 875500:875500(0) ack 125001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[3.505 A005] A.1001 > B.2000: A 125001:125201(200) ack 875501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TcpTestNet1.srv_app: received 200 bytes in 1 packets
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
